BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:chios-nea-potamia-nine-days-of-the-virgin-panigiri-nea-potamia-2027@aegeanblueprint.com
DTSTAMP:20260902T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20270823
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20270824
SUMMARY:Nine-days-of-the-Virgin panigiri\, Nea Potamia
LOCATION:Nea Potamia\, Chios\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The 'Enniamera' (ninth day after the Dormition\, 23 August) is kept as a village panigiri in the square of Nea Potamia in north-eastern Chios\, organised by the local association with a traditional orchestra (Poupaloi-Pipidis in 2024). A quieter alternative to the mid-August crowds\, popular with families from Chios town.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chios/#nea-potamia-nine-days-of-the-virgin-panigiri-nea-potamia
URL:https://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/chios/#nea-potamia-nine-days-of-the-virgin-panigiri-nea-potamia
END:VEVENT
